{
  "id": "LUK.8",
  "number": "8",
  "bookId": "LUK",
  "reference": "Luka 8",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 56,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abakungu abatunyanete Yeso",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega ase aya, akaba ngoetanana are ase emechie na ebichie, okorandia na kobateebia amang’ana amaya ay’oborwoti bwa Nyasae. Na baria ikomi na babere nigo barenge amo nere,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na abakungu bande ababwatire n’emeika emebe bakagwenigwa nere: Mariamu ore korokwa Magidalena, oria orusetigwe ebirecha bitano na bibere,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Yoana moka Kusa, omorendi bwe Herode, na Susana, na abande abange. Abwo nigo barenge kobakorera ne chinibo chiabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omoreng’anio bw’omobusuri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mat 13:1-9; Mar 4:1-9)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero omoganda omonene osangererekanete, na abanto ba kera omochie bakamochiera, agakwana ase omoreng’anio:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omobusuri akamanora kogenda kobusura embusuro yaye: Ekero akobusura, echinde chikagwa enchera ensemo, chigatiringwa namagoro, chinyoni chia igoro chigachiria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na echinde chikagwa ase egetare, chikamera, chikooma ase okomocha amaache.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na echinde chikagwa ase amagwa ime, na amagwa aria agakina amo na chirochio, agachimiga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na echinde chikagwa ase amaroba amaya, chikamera, chikama rigana.” Ekero are kobateebia aya, agaaka eriogi, akabora, “Oyore namato akoigwera, tiga aigwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogotebereria kw’omoreng’anio oria",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mat 13:10-23; Mar 4:10-20)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aborokigwa baye bakamobooria, “Omoreng’anio oyio ninki ogoteeba?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agateeba, “Inwe mwaeirwe komanya obobisi bw’oborwoti bwa Nyasae; korende abande nabateebigwe ase emereng’anio, erinde okong’ereria bariingererie, korende tibarora, naende ogotegerera bategerere, korende tibaigwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omoreng’anio noro oyo: Embusuro nering’ana ria Nyasae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baria b’enchera ensemo, nabwo baikire koriigwa; erio Saitani ochicha, na korusia ring’ana riria ase chinkoro chiabo, erinde tibacha kwegena batooreke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na baria bare ase egetare nabwo baria bakoigwa ring’ana, baribwata nomogooko, korende barabwo tibari nemeri, begena ase ekero egeke, na ekero ki’ogoteemwa beatanana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na echio chiagwete ase amagwa, aba nabwo bakoriigwa, na barabwo kobakogenderera bamigwa nokorengereria kw’enibo, na omogooko bw’ense eye, tibakwama ase ogoikerania.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na echinde chire ase amaroba amaya; aba nabwo bare ne chinkoro chingiya naende echi’ekeene, bakoigwa ring’ana, baribwata, bama okwama noboremereria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okworokereria korwa ase etaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mat 4:21-25)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omonto onde tari ogotongia etaya na koyemumeka negento, gose koyebeeka nyaro y’oborere; korende nigo akoyebeeka igoro ase ekebekerero kiaye, erinde abagosoa barore oborabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekiagera ring’ana tiriri ribisegete, ritache koorokigwa, gose eria bobisi ritache komanyekana maiso marore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwerende gaki inwe buna mokoigwa, ekiagera ere oyobwate naegwe, korende oyotabwati, naurwe nonya nkeria arengereretie abwate.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obomwabo bw’ekeene",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mat 12:46-50; Mar 3:31-35)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng’ina na bamura bamwabo bakamochiera, korende tibanyara komoika ang’e ase engencho y’omoganda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akairerwa amang’ana agateebigwa, “Nyoko na bamura bamino mbateneine isiko, baganetie kororana naye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende akabateebia, “Baba na bamura baminto nabwo aba abakoigwa ring’ana ria Nyasae na korikora.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeso ogotoereria omwaga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mat 8:23-27; Mar 4:35-41)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rituko erimo akariina obwato, ere na aborokigwa baye, akabateebia, “Twamboke gochia ng’umbu y’enyancha.” Bakamanora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kobachia kogenda, akarara chitoro; omwaga ogaacha, na emerindo ase enyancha, obwato bogaachaka goichorwa namaache, bakaba ase emechando.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakamochiera, bakamotura, bakaboora, “Omonene Nyasae, ngosira tore!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Erio ere akaboka, agatogonyera omwaga na emerindo y’amaache, na birobio bigakira, gokaba ogotoerera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabateebia, “Okwegena kwaino, ng’ai kore?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bakairoka, bagakumia bagateebania, “Oyo nere ng’o, ogochika nonya nomwaga na enyancha, bikomoigwera?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeso okogwenia Omogeraseni obwatire nebirecha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mat 8:28-34; Mar 5:1-20)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagaika engegu y’ense y’Abageraseni, erigereretie Galili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agachia goika engegu, akaumerana nomonto oyomo bw’omochie oria, obwatire nebirecha; na ase amatuko amange tarenge kweboyia chianga, tarenge komenya nyomba, otatiga ase chimbeera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agachia korora Yeso, agaaka egeturi, akagwa ase obosio bwaye, agakwana neriogi rinene, okobora, “Inaki inde naye, Yeso, Omwana o Nyasae Ore Igoro Mono? Nagosabire, tonchanda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki konya ochikiire ekerecha keria ki’eubi gesoke korwa ase omonto oria. (Ekiagera ebiro ebinge nigo kiare komobwata; nonya orenge gosibwa nebinyuri ne chingataare na korendwa, nigo arenge kobutora ebisibo biria oirwa nekerecha keria goika ase erooro.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso akamobooria, “Naki okorokwa?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akairaneria, “Elegioni”, ekiagera ebirecha ebinge biamosoete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bikamosorora tabichika bigende goika ase eora entambe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndiarengeo riicho rinene rie chimbeche, chiare korisia ase egetunwa, bikamosorora abie ribaga bichisoe. Akabia ribaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebirecha biria bigasoka korwa ase omonto oria, bigasoa chimbeche. Riicho riria rigatirimboka bwango gochia ase egeturunkano goika chikagwa enyancha ime, chikarimera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abarisia bagachia korora ayio, bagatama, bakararia amang’ana ase omochie na ebichie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto bagasoka barore amang’ana aorokire; bagachiera Yeso, bakarora omonto oria orusetigwe ebirecha biria oikaransete ase amagoro a Yeso obegete chianga, ore nebirengererio ebironge, bakairoka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na baria bayaroche bakabateebia buna oria obwatire nebirecha agwenetigwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naboigo abanto bonsi b’ense y’Abageraseni bakamobooria arue ase bare, ekiagera basoetwe nokoiroka okonene. Erio akariina obwato, akairana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na omonto oria orusetigwe ebirecha akamosorora abe amo nere, korende Yeso akamokania, akabora,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Irana nka bwoo orarie amang’ana amanene aya Nyasae agokoreire.” Akagenda bwoye, akararia ase omochie omogima amang’ana amanene aya Yeso amokoreire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omoiseke o Yairo okobokigwa, na omokungu oyorenge noborwaire bw’okorua amanyinga okogwenigwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mat 9:18-26; Mar 5:21-43)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso agachia koirana, omosangererekano okamogokera, ekiagera abanto bonsi bamoganyete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto oyomo, erieta riaye Yairo, omotang’ani bw’esinagogi, agacha, akagwa ase amagoro a Yeso, akamosorora asoe nyomba mwaye,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ekiagera narenge nomoiseke, omwana omomoima, konya okoorire emiaka ikomi na ebere, na ere nigo arenge ang’e ogokwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ekero Yeso arenge kogenda abanto bakaba bakomomiga‐miga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende omokungu oyomo oyorenge noborwaire bw’okorua amanyinga ase engaki y’emiaka ikomi na ebere, konya oonirie ebinto bionsi ebiarenge nabio ase abarwaria, tanyara kogwenigwa nonde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere agatunyana Yeso korwa magega, agakuna omokoba bw’eanga yaye; erio kegima amanyinga aye agakama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso akabooria, “Ning’o onkuna?” Ekero abanto bonsi bagakana, Petero na baria barenge amo nere bakamoteebia, “Omonene, omoganda nigo ogoetanaine na gokomiga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso agateeba, “Omonto onkunire, ekiagera naigure ng’a chinguru chiandure.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omokungu oria ekero achia korora ng’a tabisekaneti, agacha okoiguswa, akamogwera, na ase amasio ’abaanto bonsi akamworokia engencho yagera omokuna, naende buna agwenetigwe ara rimo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akamoteebia, “Omoiseke one, okwegena kwao gwakogwenirie; genda nomorembe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.48"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio kagokwana, omonto agacha korwa ase enyomba y’oria omotang’ani bw’esinagogi, akamoteebia, “Enyaroka yao yakuure, torosia omworokia naende.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso agachia koigwa aya, erio akamoiraneria, “Toiroka; egene rioka, ere nagwenigwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.50"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agachia goika nyomba, tancha monto onde asoe amo nere otatiga Petero, na Yohana, na Yakobo, na ise na ng’ina b’omwana oria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na abanto bonsi nigo barenge komoreera, bakweng’ereria, korende Yeso akabora, “Timorera, ekiagera takweti, korende nigo araire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakamosekerera, bamanyete ng’a okuure.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ere akamobwata okoboko kwaye, agateeba, “Omwana, imoka!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omoika oye okairana, agatenena erio kegima Yeso akabachiika bamoe endagera arie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 8:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaibori baye bagakumia, mono, korende akabachiika tibateebia monto ayakoreka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.8.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.8.56"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "LUK.9",
